  "defect": "Fixing both energy density epsilon0 and radius R fixes u=8pi G epsilon0 R\u00b2/(3c\u2074). The old u_n sequence did not describe admissible stars under those simultaneously fixed parameters. This was an actual proof-scope defect, not merely stale metadata or a boundary-template issue.",
