  "repair": "Hold epsilon0>0 fixed; for n>=2 choose u_n=8/9-1/n and R_n=c\u00b2 sqrt(3u_n/(8pi G epsilon0)); set rho0=epsilon0/c\u00b2 and M_n=4pi rho0 R_n\u00b3/3. Algebra gives2GM_n/(c\u00b2R_n)=u_n in(0,8/9), so each term is an admissible supplier star. Its central-pressure ratio diverges because a_n=sqrt(1/9+1/n) decreases to1/3, with numerator tending2/3 and positive denominator tending0. The mathematical lapse also tends0.",
